harness/db/schema.sql-823---
harness/db/schema.sql-824--- ⚠️ Sol #3: "The 'no screenshot, no verdict' claim is false." My original guard
harness/db/schema.sql:825:-- accepted ANY artifact — including a research source, or an empty row. So a tester
harness/db/schema.sql-826--- could "pass" a job on the strength of a URL somebody pasted. Now it must be
harness/db/schema.sql-827--- evidence the HARNESS captured by actually driving the app.
harness/db/schema.sql-828--- ===========================================================================
