harness/server.py-119-def _in_plain_english(e: dict) -> dict:
harness/server.py-120-    """Translate one line of machine activity into something a person can read.
harness/server.py-121-
harness/server.py-122-    NOTE the deliberate asymmetry: we keep the OUTCOME of a test run ("6 passed") but
harness/server.py:123:    drop the COMMAND that produced it ("pytest -q"). The outcome is a fact about the
harness/server.py-124-    work. The command is a fact about the tooling, and Neill doesn't use the tooling.
harness/server.py-125-    """
harness/server.py-126-    kind = e.get("kind", "")
harness/server.py-127-    what = _EVENT_ENGLISH.get(kind, "Worked on it")
harness/server.py-128-    out = {"what": what, "kind": kind}
