harness/gatekeeper.py-103-def _clean(text: str, limit: int = 120) -> str:
harness/gatekeeper.py-104-    """Make caller-supplied text safe to show Neill.
harness/gatekeeper.py-105-
harness/gatekeeper.py-106-    Everything written by `_note` is attributed to the gatekeeper — the one component he
harness/gatekeeper.py:107:    is being told to trust — so an agent that can inject newlines into it can forge
harness/gatekeeper.py-108-    gatekeeper-signed lines on his timeline. Strip the formatting, cap the length.
harness/gatekeeper.py-109-    """
harness/gatekeeper.py-110-    return re.sub(r"\s+", " ", str(text)).strip()[:limit]
