harness/gatekeeper.py-177-    anything — that is the entire difference between this and `dispatch.ship()`, which
harness/gatekeeper.py-178-    did the thing because it was called.
harness/gatekeeper.py-179-    """
harness/gatekeeper.py-180-    def _no(why: str) -> Refused:
