docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-67-   A poisoned instruction can put private material into a legitimate model request; a
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-68-   narrow domain allow-list doesn't help when the allowed destination is itself an exfil
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-69-   channel. (PHI in the EMR makes this non-optional.)
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-70-9. **Specify and test the full containment profile** — every runner, child process, MCP
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md:71:   server, hook, scheduled job, retry, recovery path — plus CPU/memory/disk/process/
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-72-   time/network limits. (An agent can brick the Mac by exhaustion; a budget cap stops none
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-73-   of that.)
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-74-10. **Replace the voice flow with a deterministic turn controller.** No dispatch from
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-75-    partial speech; authoritative acknowledgements only; exact warnings without voice-model
