docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-99-  hold their own credentials; a startup check is itself configuration the same compromise
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-100-  can disable.
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-101-- **Ambient speakers:** phone auth proves which phone opened the session, not who's
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-102-  talking. A passenger, radio, or podcast can issue a routine dispatch or a stop.
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md:103:- **Private information beyond credentials** (source, business plans, issues, memory,
docs/SOL_VERDICT_ROUND4_2026-07-14.md-104-  customer/medical data) has no egress rule at all.
