docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-55-### The design flaw
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-56-
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md:57:§5.1 has the voice layer tool-calling "the GPT-5.6 orchestrator which holds the harness memory,
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-58-subagents, and reasoning." **That routes every voice turn through a deep reasoning model** — even
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-59-"what did the overnight run do?" The spec then papers over it with a canned ~300ms "on it, kicking
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-60-that off" while the slow model grinds. That's a bandaid on a design problem.
