docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-83-### ⚠️ The landmine — this kills the Claude Max head, and possibly the whole subscription premise
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-84-
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-85-**CLI-based runtimes cannot be in a per-turn voice loop:**
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-86-
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md:87:- `claude -p` subprocess: **3–5s overhead per call.** Cited discussion says this makes "use cases
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-88-  like voice assistants **prohibitively slow**."
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-89-- Claude Agent SDK `query()`: **~12s overhead per call**, no hot-process reuse
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-90-  ([claude-agent-sdk-typescript#34](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-typescript/issues/34)).
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-91-- With process pre-warming/reuse: drops to <1s. Without it, you eat the full cost **every turn**.
docs/OSS_RESEARCH_2026-07-11.md-92-- Direct Messages API: 1–3s end-to-end.
