harness/db/schema.sql-122-   'The records system for the addiction-recovery facility — staff, beds, roles, approvals, the voice assistant Archie. Voice-first. Held at arm''s length here on purpose: Chief can read its notes but the fleet does not touch its code or its patient data.',
harness/db/schema.sql-123-   '#22c55e');
harness/db/schema.sql-124-
harness/db/schema.sql:125:-- Project memory: facts that belong to the PROJECT, not to an agent and not to a job.
harness/db/schema.sql-126--- "The API returns snake_case." "Never touch the billing table directly."
