docs/sol/review_task10_gauntlet.out-8435-
docs/sol/review_task10_gauntlet.out:8436:   However, the outer exception path writes no event, and a thread still alive after the join only gets an in-memory skipped string. `executor.run_job()` discards the `PanelResult`, so the individual reason disappears. Separately, final parent writes catch only `GuardViolation`; a lock failure there escapes `run_job()`, whose `finally` closes the connection but records no failure despite claiming it never raises.
