docs/sol/sol_round4.out-933---
docs/sol/sol_round4.out-934--- This matters more than it looks. Memory that isn't scoped to a project leaks:
docs/sol/sol_round4.out-935--- lessons from the EMR bleed into the harness, conventions from one codebase get
docs/sol/sol_round4.out:936:-- applied to another. Chief already keeps per-AGENT memory; this is per-PROJECT,
docs/sol/sol_round4.out-937--- and the two are different axes. Riggs knows how HE works; the project knows how
docs/sol/sol_round4.out-938--- IT works.
docs/sol/sol_round4.out-939--- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
