docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2426-- Write any file at layer 1 or 2
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2427-- Run shell commands at layer 1 or 2
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2428-- Access GitHub unless you explicitly add the token to the allowlist
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2429-- Access AWS / cloud providers
