docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2442-  worth explicit.)
docs/sol/sol_round1.out:2443:- **Direct memory write:** should Chief voice be able to append to memory
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2444-  files directly (option 1 above), or only via dispatch (option 2)?
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2445-- **Auto-suggest scope switch on implicit cross-project mention:** ship
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-2446-  in v1.1?
