docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7516-### “Stopped and tapped” is not enforceable
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7517-
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7518-The system cannot know that the car is stopped merely because the screen was tapped. Do not state this as a machine guarantee.
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7519-
docs/sol/sol_round1.out:7520:### Long conversation history is unsafe as operational memory
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7521-
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7522-Summaries can lose a “not,” revive a cancelled instruction, mix projects, retain prompt injection, or misstate an approval.
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7523-
docs/sol/sol_round1.out-7524-Conversation summaries may help natural dialogue. They must never determine:
