docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-322-### The design flaw
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-323-
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt:324:§5.1 has the voice layer tool-calling "the GPT-5.6 orchestrator which holds the harness memory,
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-325-subagents, and reasoning." **That routes every voice turn through a deep reasoning model** — even
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-326-"what did the overnight run do?" The spec then papers over it with a canned ~300ms "on it, kicking
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-327-that off" while the slow model grinds. That's a bandaid on a design problem.
