docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-853-## What the hook does
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-854-
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt:855:Before every user turn hits `_handle_text_turn` (Riggs's memory-loaded LLM
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-856-path), the hook:
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-857-
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-858-1. Runs `detect_project_switch` (Riggs's regex) — scope changes don't need
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-859-   a classifier call.
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-860-2. Runs `classify_intent` (Nova's classifier) → returns one of
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-861-   `chat | task | status | cancel`.
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-862-3. Routes:
