docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8873-
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8874-**Adopt as-is**
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8875-- OpenClaw core, **pinned to an exact version** — seats as `agents.list[]`, `codex` plugin for the
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt:8876:  orchestrator, `agentRuntime.id: "claude-cli"` for the Claude seat.
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8877-- Native subagents for dispatch (`maxSpawnDepth: 2`, per-spawn `model` override).
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8878-- `autoreview` skill as the gauntlet spine.
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8879-- `openclaw gateway install` (launchd) + Tailscale Serve auto-config.
docs/sol/sol_out2.txt-8880-- **Pipecat** (BSD-2) as the voice framework; `kokoro-onnx` via `pipecat-ai[kokoro]` for TTS;
