docs/sol/sol_round3.out-562-  path: restoring old configuration must not revive old credentials, stale approvals,
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-563-  unsafe automation, or a decommissioned release route.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-564-- **Tamper-resistant audit records**, stored off this Mac and off the trusted account,
