docs/sol/sol_round3.out-566-  present on the Mac).
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-567-- **Secret lifecycle**: creation, limited delivery, rotation schedule, expiration,
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-568-  emergency revocation, and verification that old copies are gone (including from
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-569-  snapshots and backups). Incident response: device loss, compromised phone session,
docs/sol/sol_round3.out:570:  poisoned memory, release-path compromise.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-571-- **Crash recovery**: on startup, reconcile any in-progress job with a dead run — never
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-572-  silently lost; a stale approval can't remain live when unattended work resumes.
