docs/sol/sol_round3.out-919-
docs/sol/sol_round3.out:920:- CPU, memory, heat, battery, storage and network exhaustion.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-921-- A dynamically expanding virtual disk filling the host.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-922-- Access to the Mac, local network, tailnet, router, printers, storage devices or other business machines through ordinary networking.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-923-- Shared folders other than the owner’s home, drag-and-drop, USB, microphone, camera, Bluetooth, printers and virtual-device connections.
docs/sol/sol_round3.out-924-- VM snapshots, crash dumps and backups retaining credentials or private source.
